                                                "sense_id": "0dc62f00-84fa-3166-8787-afce1b5cef39",
                                                "text": "He's the FBI agent antagonist in Catch Me If You Can (2002) opposite a buoyantly charming young Leonardo DiCaprio as con artist Frank Abagnale, but his character is more of a determined cat to Leo's mouse than a real foil; he's simply a prim Eisenhower-era man with a job to do."
